{"root":{"data":{"id":"dle40c1pbsw0","created":1789294627248,"text":"数据链路层"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dle4i443eqo0","created":1789296020533,"text":"组帧（封装成帧）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dle4iefj0sg0","created":1789296042992,"text":"主要问题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dle4iefj0kg0","created":1789296042992,"text":"##### 帧定界"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dle4iefio540","created":1789296042992,"text":"- 如何让接收方能够确定帧的界限"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dle4iefjdpc0","created":1789296042993,"text":"##### 透明传输"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dle4iefjnyg0","created":1789296042993,"text":"- 接收方链路层能够从收到的帧内恢复原始 SDU，让网络层“感受不到”将分组封装成帧的过程"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dle4iefjl080","created":1789296042993,"text":"- 接收方能够去除“帧定界”的附加信息，把帧“恢复原貌”"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dle4iefjom80","created":1789296042993,"text":"#### 四种组帧方法"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dle4iefjork0","created":1789296042993,"text":"##### 字符计数法"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dle4iefjctk0","created":1789296042993,"text":"##### 字节填充法"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dle4iefjhgg0","created":1789296042993,"text":"##### 零比特填充法"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dle4iefjlrs0","created":1789296042993,"text":"##### 违规编码法"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}